### Roomly API requests. Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, or copy into Postman.
@base = http://localhost:8001/api

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Register a customer
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Asha Verma", "email": "asha@example.com", "phone": "+919876543210", "password": "Passw0rd123", "confirmPassword": "Passw0rd123" }

### Login (copy "token" from the response into @token below)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "asha@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd123" }

@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### Current user
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rooms free for a date range (use future dates)
GET {{base}}/rooms?checkIn=2026-12-10&checkOut=2026-12-12

### Create a booking (replace ROOM_ID; total is calculated by the server)
POST {{base}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomId": "ROOM_ID", "fromDate": "2026-12-10", "toDate": "2026-12-12", "guestName": "Asha Verma", "phone": "+919876543210", "paymentOutcome": "success" }

### My bookings
GET {{base}}/bookings/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancel a booking
PATCH {{base}}/bookings/BOOKING_ID/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer must be refused here (expect 403)
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registration cannot create an admin: the "role" field is ignored (user comes back as "customer")
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mallory", "email": "mallory@example.com", "phone": "+919876543211", "password": "Passw0rd123", "confirmPassword": "Passw0rd123", "role": "admin" }

### Admin: log in with the seeded admin, then call these with the admin token
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

###
GET {{base}}/admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{base}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Add a room
POST {{base}}/rooms
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "roomNumber": "D-202", "type": "Double", "description": "Double room with garden view.", "rent": 3000, "count": 3, "amenities": ["Wi-Fi", "Breakfast"], "photos": [] }
